  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="e4ee2d7f-ee75-5f7e-a3bd-0b1ddd8c3038" activityNameId="bb2865b6-5084-57a5-9f84-2041861ba27a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Resistor, wirewound, through-hole mounting, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Resistor, wirewound, through-hole mounting, at plant
The data represent a typical wirewound type resistor for through-hole mounting, used in the information and communication technology. Material data are taken from datasheets of producers of such resistors. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents 1 kg of resistors with a weight of 3.8 gram/unit. Updates were made in 2023, mainly concerning the regionalization of energy and material input flows; UUID: f832369b-ae4b-3c3c-a63a-b7aa12d93fb9
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of currently used wirewound resistors for through-hole mounting technology.
Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of wirewound type resistors.
Technology: Average technology for the production of resistors and potentiometers - comprising terminmation printing; resistive body printing; glass coat printing; laser trimming; substrate stripping (SMT) resp. ceramic rods; deposition processes; ageing; capping (THT) resp. printing; curing; punching; revetting; molding (ptoentiom.)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f832369b-ae4b-3c3c-a63a-b7aa12d93fb9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
